<br><br><b>[Gasper]</b> <b>[Wil-Con]</b> I, like some people are poor and we would much rather buy a new game every 4 months then pay $10 a month just to play this, so I want you guys to consider adding a mode where you can play for free and put advertising banners on your screen when you play in this mode so those who don't or can't pay the $10 can still enjoy this awsome game you guys are gonna release.
