<br><br><b>[Gasper]</b> <b>[Volenmere]</b> What kind of system/hardware are you guys targetting for the "typical" user? Or minimum? I know these are bound to change, but just a genreal Idea? And what 3D "engine" is Origin using? D3d, OpenGL, Glide, mixture?
